# Keep the build context to the Go module + CUDA sources. This is a live
# multi-session dev box: the repo root accumulates VCS metadata, host-local
# session/dispatch state, and editor/tool caches (some containing symlinks
# Docker's build-context tar cannot resolve, e.g. .dispatch-runs' pin
# symlinks to an absolute host path). The `go` tool itself already ignores
# any dot-prefixed file/dir when resolving packages (embeds included), so
# excluding them here mirrors an existing invariant rather than inventing a
# new one — nothing under a dot-prefixed path can be part of a buildable
# package.
.*
*.exe
*.exe~
